    "description": "Feng Shui Gemstone Tree\nGreen Gemstone and Gold Tone Wire\nHeight: Approximately 5 inches\nThis decorative Feng Shui gemstone tree, often referred to as a \"Money Tree\" or \"Fortune Tree,\" features numerous polished green gemstone chips, likely aventurine, delicately wired to form the foliage. The trunk and branches are constructed from twisted gold-tone wire, allowing for slight adjustment of the canopy. The entire structure is anchored to a substantial, rough-cut natural stone base, providing both stability and an organic aesthetic to the piece.\nPolished green gemstone chips resembling aventurine or jade\nTwisted gold-tone wire trunk and branches for a shimmering finish\nNatural, rough-hewn stone base with felt pads on the underside for surface protection\nStanding approximately 5 inches tall, ideal for desk or shelf display\nCondition:\nVery good condition overall with average wear consistent with age and display. The wire structure remains sturdy and the gemstone chips are securely attached. The natural stone base shows inherent mineral variations and textures. The felt pads on the bottom show light wear. No significant damage or missing components observed.",
